        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PARFAVCOM, Parthenon Rose With Fifth Avenue Knob Combo</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Parthenon Rose With Fifth Avenue Knob Single Cylinder Combo is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware and has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. This single cylinder entry set features a classic design that is slightly floral while the beading around the perimeter keeps it from being too soft. The Fifth Avenue ball shape is timeless, its simple design allowing that of the Parthenon Rose and matching deadbolt to shine. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Single Cylinder Parthenon Entry Set With Eden Prairie Knob fits doors 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-parthenon-series\"><b>Parthenon Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Parthenon Rose With Fifth Avenue Knob Single Cylinder Combo:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Parthenon Rose With Fifth Avenue Knob Combo :\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Height: 7.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Knob Diameter: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Knob Projection: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 3.34\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.52\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PAR-plate.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Parthenon Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FAV-knob.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Knob Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PAR-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Parthenon Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
